### 1. Register Merchant (Already done, but here for reference)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/merchants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@capetowncoffee.com",
  "password": "supersecretpassword",
  "name": "Cape Town Coffee Co.",
  "cryptoWallet": "0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678"
}

### 2. Create Invoice
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "6c16db1d-5476-4868-954e-f15cb668088b",
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Flat White Coffee",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 35.50
    },
    {
      "name": "Croissant",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 45.00
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Create x402 Intent (MUST DO BEFORE SETTLING)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/x402/intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "d9ff1d30-a625-4381-bff0-cf73b97f70d7",
  "network": "eip155:84532",
  "payTo": "0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678"
}

### 4. Request Payment (Simulate Scanning QR)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/x402/pay/d9ff1d30-a625-4381-bff0-cf73b97f70d7

### 5. Settle Payment (Simulate Customer Paid)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/x402/settle/33581d6b-b2f4-4e5e-a53d-e19311611e89
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txHash": "0xabc1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef"
}